</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>So faith bounds forward to its goal in God,</l><l>And love can trust her Lord to lead her there;</l><l>Upheld by Him, my soul is following hard</l><l>Till God hath full fulfilled my deepest prayer.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>No matter if the way be sometimes dark,</l><l>No matter though the cost be oft-times great,</l><l>He knoweth how I best shall reach the mark,</l><l>The way that leads to Him must needs be strait.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>One thing I know, I cannot say Him nay;</l><l>One thing I do, I press towards my Lord;</l><l>My God my glory here, from day to day,</l><l>And in the glory there my great Reward.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
